Prometheus: Prometheus is an open source tool designed specifically to collect and process time - series numerical metrics.
Best for : Infrastructure health, error rates, CPU/Memory usage and real - time numerical alerts.

Grafana: Grafana is an open source visualization engine. It does not collect its own data; instead, it plugs into other backend systems and transforms raw data into dashboards.

Key features of Grafana: It is highly customizable interactive panels and ability to combine metcis logs and trace visulization into a single screen.
It is best for: Display unified dashboards across multiple tools and providing a visual view for Devops teams.

